# Inference is configured centrally — set NEBIUS_API_KEY in the repo-root compute.env (see COMPUTE.md).

# Optional: override the model. Any model id the shared config can resolve works, e.g.
#   mistralai/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct  cheaper
#   openai/gpt-4.1-mini · google/gemini-2.5-flash · qwen/qwen3-14b
MODEL_NAME=mistralai/mistral-large-2512

# A 300-round duopoly run = ~600 model calls. Scripts print the count and ask before spending.
